# reports/final/.gitkeep
# =============================================================================
# This directory stores all FINAL consolidated reports.
# Reports are grouped by scan_id — one subdirectory per scan.
# =============================================================================
#
# FUTURE DIRECTORY STRUCTURE:
#
#   reports/final/
#   ├── SCAN-550e8400/
#   │   ├── final-risk-score.json         — Combined static + runtime risk score
#   │   ├── deployment-decision.json      — Final ALLOW / REVIEW / BLOCK decision
#   │   └── combined-summary.json         — Executive summary across all stages
#   │
#   ├── SCAN-a1b2c3d4/
#   │   └── ...
#   │
#   └── SCAN-ff001122/
#       └── ...
#
# DESIGN NOTES:
#   - Final reports represent the authoritative security assessment for a scan
#   - The deployment-decision.json records the outcome visible in the future dashboard
#   - The combined-summary.json is the primary input for future dashboard visualization
#   - All final reports include the scan_id, repository_url, and commit_sha
#     to provide full context for the decision
#
# All JSON report files are excluded from Git via .gitignore.
# Only this .gitkeep file is tracked by Git.
# =============================================================================
